{
  "name": "nested-media",
  "note": "@supports nests inside @media and @media nests inside @supports with the existing flattening: rules inside both apply when the media query matches the viewport and the condition holds, a failing @supports drops its block inside a passing @media, and a passing @supports inside a non-matching @media stays gated by the media query.",
